  <Docs>
    <summary>A CombinedVibration describes a combination of haptic effects to be performed by one or more
            <c>Vibrator Vibrators</c>.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>A CombinedVibration describes a combination of haptic effects to be performed by one or more
            <c>Vibrator Vibrators</c>.
            
            These effects may be any number of things, from single shot vibrations to complex waveforms.</para>
